# Cap the V8 old-space for every `npm run` script in this package.
#
# This is a fix, not a tuning knob. `vite build` on a memory-constrained machine
# dies with `FATAL ERROR: Zone Allocation failed - process out of memory` while
# the heap is still small (~290 MB) — V8 keeps expanding until the OS refuses the
# allocation, and on an 8 GB box with ~600 MB free that happens long before the
# default ~2.2 GB ceiling. Naming a lower ceiling makes V8 collect aggressively
# as it approaches the limit instead of growing into a wall, and the same build
# then completes in under two seconds.
#
# 1024 MB is roughly three times the build's observed peak, so it constrains
# nothing real. Raise it only if a build legitimately needs more, and prefer
# splitting the bundle first.
node-options=--max-old-space-size=1024
